					<description><![CDATA[DataScientia is pleased to share the successful delivery of the seminar “AI for All: Initiatives, Pathways, and Training Opportunities”, presented by Matteo Busso (University of Trento, Department of Information Engineering and Computer Science) during ICT Days 2026. The seminar took place on April 23, &#8230; ]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div data-elementor-type="wp-post" data-elementor-id="32295" class="elementor elementor-32295">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16fd9c79 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="16fd9c79" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23f82517 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="23f82517" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-32310 size-full" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner.png" alt="" width="1548" height="396" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner.png 1548w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner-300x77.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner-1024x262.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner-768x196.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner-1536x393.png 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DS-News-2026-05-news8-banner-600x153.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1548px) 100vw, 1548px" /></p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-20665e79 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="20665e79" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p data-start="37" data-end="507">DataScientia is pleased to share the successful delivery of the seminar <strong data-start="436" data-end="503">“AI for All: Initiatives, Pathways, and Training Opportunities”</strong>, presented by <span data-start="636" data-end="748">Matteo Busso </span><span data-start="636" data-end="748">(<a style="background-color: #ffffff;" href="https://www.unitn.it/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of Trento</a><span style="font-weight: bold;">, </span><a href="https://www.disi.unitn.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Information Engineering and Computer Science</a>)</span> during <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">ICT Days 2026</span></span>.</p><p data-start="665" data-end="887">The seminar took place on April 23, 2026, at the CLab – School of Innovation in Trento, as part of a broader initiative bringing together academia, industry, and students to explore emerging technologies and future skills.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a486610 elementor-arrows-position-inside elementor-pagination-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-carousel" data-id="a486610" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;slides_to_show&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;navigation&quot;:&quot;both&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;infinite&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500}" data-widget_type="image-carousel.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-image-carousel-wrapper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Image Carousel" dir="ltr">
			<div class="elementor-image-carousel swiper-wrapper" aria-live="off">
								<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 4"><figure class="swiper-slide-inner"><img decoding="async" class="swiper-slide-image" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20260423_153729-1024x768.jpg" alt="20260423_153729" /></figure></div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 4"><figure class="swiper-slide-inner"><img decoding="async" class="swiper-slide-image" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20260423_161036-scaled-e1777890507580-1024x765.jpg" alt="20260423_161036" /></figure></div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 4"><figure class="swiper-slide-inner"><img decoding="async" class="swiper-slide-image" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3764-scaled-e1777890394780-1024x781.jpeg" alt="IMG_3764" /></figure></div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 4"><figure class="swiper-slide-inner"><img decoding="async" class="swiper-slide-image" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3765-scaled-e1777890456873-1024x776.jpeg" alt="IMG_3765" /></figure></div>			</div>
												<div class="elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-prev" role="button" tabindex="0">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-chevron-left" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z"></path></svg>					</div>
					<div class="elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-next" role="button" tabindex="0">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-chevron-right" viewBox="0 0 1000 1000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z"></path></svg>					</div>
				
									<div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
									</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-944f2ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="944f2ff" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p data-start="889" data-end="1329">The session focused on the role of education in enabling individuals to understand Artificial Intelligence, critically assess its impact, and actively contribute to its responsible and human-centered development. It showcased initiatives promoted by the Department of Information Engineering and Computer Science in collaboration with the Knowdive group and DataScientia, highlighting the integration of education, research, and innovation.</p><p data-start="1331" data-end="1744">Particular attention was given to European projects such as <a href="https://www.edvance.it/edvance/app/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PNRR EDVANCE EAI</a> and <a href="https://www.cycat.io/projects/ai4everyone/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Erasmus+ AI4EVERYONE</a>, which aim to expand access to high-quality, inclusive AI education through modular and accessible training pathways. The seminar presented a range of educational opportunities, including courses for students and staff, online learning formats, MOOCs, and specialized initiatives such as Winter Schools.</p><p data-start="1746" data-end="2137">The event gathered participants both onsite and online. In addition to <strong data-start="1817" data-end="1853">13 registrations for the webinar</strong>, the seminar was attended in person by <strong data-start="1893" data-end="1989">PhD scholars, researchers, and members of the academic community at the University of Trento</strong>, reflecting strong local engagement. Online participants joined from multiple locations including Trento, Verona and various other places.</p><p data-start="2139" data-end="2353">The seminar contributes to the dissemination and outreach objectives of the <a href="https://www.cycat.io/projects/ai4everyone/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Erasmus+ AI4EVERYONE project</a>, supporting the development of AI literacy and inclusive training opportunities across diverse audiences.</p><p data-start="2139" data-end="2353"><strong>Materials from the seminar are now available below:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="2139" data-end="2353"><a href="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026_AIforALL_Matteo_Busso_ICT-days.pdf">Download Slides PDF</a></li></ul><p data-start="1704" data-end="1962" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><b>Useful links</b></p><ul><li data-start="1704" data-end="1962"><a href="https://www.ictdays.it/programma/seminario-ai-per-tutti/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read more</a> about the seminar. </li><li data-start="1704" data-end="1962"><a href="https://www.ictdays.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read more</a> about ICT Days 2026</li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
